    <string name="about_description">Programu ya kitaalamu ya kupanga vidhibiti vidogo vya PIC kwa kutumia KITSRUS &lt;b&gt;Protocol P018&lt;/b&gt;. Inakuruhusu kupanga vifaa vya PIC moja kwa moja kutoka kwa Android kupitia USB OTG bila hitaji la Kompyuta.</string>
    <string name="about_features">Vipengele kuu:</string>
    <string name="about_feature_1">Programu ya rununu bila PC kupitia OTG.</string>
    <string name="about_feature_2">Usaidizi wa itifaki za KITSRUS P018 (K150, K128, K149, K182).</string>
    <string name="about_feature_3">Kiolesura cha Usanifu wa Nyenzo Intuitive.</string>
    <string name="about_feature_4">Usaidizi wa usanifu wa arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a, x86 na x86_64.</string>
    <string name="about_acknowledgements_title">Shukrani:</string>
    <string name="about_acknowledgements_desc">Shukrani za pekee kwa Mike Wakely, Adam Schubert, na AndroidIDE, Android Code Studio, na timu za KITSRUS.</string>
