    <string name="hex_editor_desc_rom">• PIC huhifadhi maneno ya biti 14/16 kwa mpangilio wa Little-Endian:
   - Baiti ya Chini (LSB): 0x%1$s (kikomo 2×N)
   - Baiti ya Juu (MSB): 0x%2$s (kikomo 2×N+1)
• Jinsi ya kuhariri?: Weka neno kamili la kimantiki [MSB][LSB] (mfano 2805 = LSB 05, MSB 28).
• Programu hupanga upya baiti kiotomatiki kuwa Little-Endian kwa silicon na faili ya HEX.</string>
    <string name="hex_editor_desc_eeprom">• Seli za EEPROM zinajumuisha baiti moja moja za biti 8.
• Weka baiti ya hexadecimal ya herufi 2 moja kwa moja (masafa: 00 hadi FF).</string>
